  {
   "title": "The Republic Dark Age",
   "date": "c. 1100–1000 BBY · the Draggulch Period",
   "view": "galaxy",
   "text": "The Republic contracts to the Core. Its currency collapses, its Senate meets and decides nothing, and the Jedi become Jedi Lords ruling worlds in its name. Beyond the Core the hyperlanes go unmaintained and whole regions drop off the charts; what the Sith do not rule outright, nobody rules at all.",
