  {
   "title": "The Charge Matrica",
   "date": "1066–1040 BBY · the Calimondra inheritance",
   "view": {
    "center": [
     4435,
     6600
    ],
    "w": 1250
   },
   "text": "The Grumani sector belongs to one family. Vilia Calimondra — a Sith Lord with many husbands and seven children — sets her heirs to war for her inheritance in 1066 BBY: the Charge Matrica, whoever conquers most inherits all. Sixteen years later her son Chagras is the only child left alive. His Chagras Hegemony holds the sector from Darkknell to Syned, and by 1042 BBY it reaches for the Republic beyond — the University of Sanbra sacked, Aquilaris Minor taken and its people massacred by his nephew Odion. Two years on, Chagras dies of a nerve toxin nobody admits to administering.",
   "polities": [
