  {
   "title": "The Hegemony breaks",
   "date": "1040–1033 BBY · the Second Charge Matrica",
   "view": {
    "center": [
     4435,
     6600
    ],
    "w": 1250
   },
   "text": "Vilia sets the contest running again among her grandchildren, and the Hegemony shatters into princedoms. Daiman rules from Darkknell as the self-declared Creator of the Universe; his brother Odion, the Destroyer, raises a cult of annihilation in the east and fills a cloister world with orphans. Between them the family's old Quermian friend Ayanos Bactra runs the Bactranate from Jutrand as a business. Chagras's daughter Arkadia keeps a tidy, remote dictatorship under the ice of Syned; her infant siblings Dromika and Quillan hold Byllura as the Dyarchy, a whole population kept by mind control. Malakite fights with engineered beasts, a Sullustan warlord holds the Brema sector, and from Hutt Space, Zodoh watches.",
