  {
   "title": "Knight Errant",
   "date": "1032 BBY · the last map the Republic drew of this country",
   "view": {
    "center": [
     4435,
     6600
    ],
    "w": 1250
   },
   "text": "One Jedi, Kerra Holt, fights a private war through the sector while the family finishes itself. Daiman burns Chelloa rather than lose its baradium; the brothers trap each other at Gazzari; on Vilia's word the grandchildren turn on Bactra, and the Bactranate is gone in days, its worlds shared out at a family bequest. Quillan is kidnapped, the Dyarchy's mind-lock breaks, and Arkadia annexes Byllura. Zodoh's Stormdrivers drown Daiman's worlds — Aquilaris among them — until his fleet breaks over Darkknell; Odion takes the Helm of Ieldis on Skarpos and dies at Vanahame. What remains is the last thing the Republic ever writes down about this country — and the floor the Run is built on.",
