  {
   "title": "Ruusan",
   "date": "1000 BBY · the seven battles",
   "view": {
    "focus": "Ruusan",
    "w": 1100
   },
   "text": "Seven battles are fought on and above Ruusan. When the last goes against him, Kaan leads the Brotherhood into a cave and detonates the thought bomb: every Sith Lord present and every Jedi near enough dies with him, Lord Hoth among them. Darth Bane, who had already judged the Brotherhood a corruption, is not present. He leaves Ruusan with an apprentice and the Rule of Two.",
