  {
   "title": "Ninety years on",
   "date": "90 AR · the present",
   "view": "reach",
   "text": "The Republic of the Reformation has senators for every sector and a navy for none. The lanes that went dark in the Dark Age are still dark; the Duros Space Run has been relit one beacon at a time by prize money, not policy, and Bannistar Station is where the money ran out. Somewhere beyond the last lit beacon, the Rule of Two has been keeping its own history for ninety years.",
